@startuml packages
' Module dependencies. Maven enforces them, so there are no cycles.
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
package "raktsetu-cli" as cli
package "raktsetu-sim" as sim
package "raktsetu-engine" as engine
package "raktsetu-persistence" as persistence
package "raktsetu-domain" as domain
cli --> sim
cli --> engine
cli --> persistence
cli --> domain
sim --> engine
sim --> domain
engine --> domain
persistence --> domain
note right of domain : pure Java, no dependencies
@enduml
